Add scroll wheel support for cycling through dropdown values on hover.

When hovering over a combo dropdown (preset selector, mode selector),
scroll wheel should cycle through the available options without
opening the dropdown menu.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Scroll wheel on preset combo cycles through presets
- [ ] Scroll wheel on mode combo cycles through modes
- [ ] Visual feedback shows the current selection changing
- [ ] Works in both standalone and plugin

## Test Plan
- [ ] Hover preset, scroll up/down, verify preset changes
- [ ] Hover mode, scroll, verify mode changes
